{"post_stream": {"posts": [{"id": 224697, "name": "akintilo steeven", "username": "sangokuhomer", "avatar_template": "https://avatars.discourse-cdn.com/v4/letter/s/db3279/{size}.png", "created_at": "2023-06-07T16:51:04.179Z", "cooked": "<p>Hello since yesterday everytime I tried to launch docker but I got this message saying “I don’t have space left on my device”. I’ve done df-h command (see screen) and I have like no space left on my root while I have a lot of free space left on home.<br>\nI’ve done a lot of research but I tought that the best answer would come from the official fedora “help group”<br>\nhow can I free some space on root ? Can I reduce the space of home and give some to root ? Any help would be good thanks.<br>\n<div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/fedoraproject/original/3X/f/5/f504ba2f732f484fa71e751b4c0f88d1951ff1ec.png\" data-download-href=\"/uploads/short-url/yXx6IMDIPW9qOBzxZPyzTnBwxMo.png?dl=1\" title=\"Screenshot_2023-06-07_18-49-01\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\"><img src=\"https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/fedoraproject/optimized/3X/f/5/f504ba2f732f484fa71e751b4c0f88d1951ff1ec_2_621x500.png\" alt=\"Screenshot_2023-06-07_18-49-01\" data-base62-sha1=\"yXx6IMDIPW9qOBzxZPyzTnBwxMo\" width=\"621\" height=\"500\" srcset=\"https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/fedoraproject/optimized/3X/f/5/f504ba2f732f484fa71e751b4c0f88d1951ff1ec_2_621x500.png, https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/fedoraproject/optimized/3X/f/5/f504ba2f732f484fa71e751b4c0f88d1951ff1ec_2_931x750.png 1.5x, https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/fedoraproject/original/3X/f/5/f504ba2f732f484fa71e751b4c0f88d1951ff1ec.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"111111\"><div class=\"meta\">\n<svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">Screenshot_2023-06-07_18-49-01</span><span class=\"informations\">1158×931 136 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg>\n</div></a></div></p>", "post_number": 1, "post_type": 1, "posts_count": 4, "updated_at": "2023-06-22T14:30:32.065Z", "reply_count": 0, "reply_to_post_number": null, "quote_count": 0, "incoming_link_count": 238, "reads": 22, "readers_count": 21, "score": 1194.4, "yours": false, "topic_id": 83938, "topic_slug": "dont-have-space-left-on-my-device-fedora-36", "display_username": "akintilo steeven", "primary_group_name": null, "flair_name": null, "flair_url": null, "flair_bg_color": null, "flair_color": null, "flair_group_id": null, "badges_granted": [], "version": 2, "can_edit": false, "can_delete": false, "can_recover": false, "can_see_hidden_post": false, "can_wiki": false, "link_counts": [{"url": "https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/fedoraproject/original/3X/f/5/f504ba2f732f484fa71e751b4c0f88d1951ff1ec.png", "internal": false, "reflection": false, "title": "f504ba2f732f484fa71e751b4c0f88d1951ff1ec.png", "clicks": 0}], "read": true, "user_title": null, "bookmarked": false, "actions_summary": [], "moderator": false, "admin": false, "staff": false, "user_id": 15200, "hidden": false, "trust_level": 0, "deleted_at": null, "user_deleted": false, "edit_reason": null, "can_view_edit_history": true, "wiki": false, "mentioned_users": [], "post_url": "/t/dont-have-space-left-on-my-device-fedora-36/83938/1", "event": null, "calendar_details": [], "reactions": [], "current_user_reaction": null, "reaction_users_count": 0, "current_user_used_main_reaction": false, "can_accept_answer": false, "can_unaccept_answer": false, "accepted_answer": false, "topic_accepted_answer": null}, {"id": 224703, "name": "Matthew Miller", "username": "mattdm", "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/discussion.fedoraproject.org/mattdm/{size}/2450_2.png", "created_at": "2023-06-07T18:41:02.947Z", "cooked": "<p>Can you run <code>df -Tlh -x tmpfs -x devtmpfs</code> and show us the output of that? That will tell us the filesystem types in use.</p>\n<p>Also, a tip: rather than a screenshot, if it’s best if you can copy the output and then paste it here between two lines that each contain  three backticks — like this:</p>\n<pre><code>```\nyour output here\n```\n</code></pre>", "post_number": 2, "post_type": 1, "posts_count": 4, "updated_at": "2023-06-07T18:41:13.151Z", "reply_count": 1, "reply_to_post_number": null, "quote_count": 0, "incoming_link_count": 1, "reads": 17, "readers_count": 16, "score": 13.4, "yours": false, "topic_id": 83938, "topic_slug": "dont-have-space-left-on-my-device-fedora-36", "display_username": "Matthew Miller", "primary_group_name": "discussion-bots", "flair_name": "discussion-bots", "flair_url": null, "flair_bg_color": "", "flair_color": "", "flair_group_id": 52, "badges_granted": [], "version": 1, "can_edit": false, "can_delete": false, "can_recover": false, "can_see_hidden_post": false, "can_wiki": false, "read": true, "user_title": "Flock 2013 Speaker", "title_is_group": false, "bookmarked": false, "actions_summary": [], "moderator": true, "admin": true, "staff": true, "group_moderator": true, "user_id": 5, "hidden": false, "trust_level": 2, "deleted_at": null, "user_deleted": false, "edit_reason": null, "can_view_edit_history": true, "wiki": false, "mentioned_users": [], "post_url": "/t/dont-have-space-left-on-my-device-fedora-36/83938/2", "event": null, "reactions": [], "current_user_reaction": null, "reaction_users_count": 0, "current_user_used_main_reaction": false, "can_accept_answer": false, "can_unaccept_answer": false, "accepted_answer": false, "topic_accepted_answer": null}, {"id": 224714, "name": "akintilo steeven", "username": "sangokuhomer", "avatar_template": "https://avatars.discourse-cdn.com/v4/letter/s/db3279/{size}.png", "created_at": "2023-06-07T19:50:56.873Z", "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-discussion-bots\" data-username=\"mattdm\" data-post=\"2\" data-topic=\"83938\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" wid